  check ("tags" <@ array['Fiction'::text, 'Science'::text, 'History'::text]);
```

Against a `jsonb` column this fails with `ERROR: 42883 operator does not exist: jsonb <@ text[]`, so `schema:create` and generated migrations are broken. 

You can see the failing test and the fix in this [PR](https://github.com/mikro-orm/mikro-orm/pull/8184) - please tell me if the fix is wrong 

